        "value": "'Troops' sub-header — the tail of the fascicle-8 running header (藩制一覧表第八 職員 兵隊), printed below 職員 in the outer running-header column. Ink-verified at 8x reads 兵 over 隊 (y2242-2389, x2572-2637). Sits in a 49px clean gap BELOW box-00's bottom edge (y2183), so geometrically unboxed by any existing box; proposed rect encloses it with zero overlap of box-00 (y-overlap=0). NOTE: box-00's transcription already includes 兵隊 in its text, so this is the header-tail glyph made independently clickable rather than a new datum."
